# ONE link: Radxa USB -> USB-to-TTL -> FC TELEM2. Review in QGC; not an import file.
# Baseline PX4 v1.14.3. Confirm TELEM2 mapping / actual MAVLink instance on NXT PX4 v2.
# Only apply MAV_1_* if instance 1 is the intended TELEM2 companion link.
UXRCE_DDS_CFG 0
MAV_1_CONFIG 102
MAV_1_MODE 2
SER_TEL2_BAUD 921600
MAV_1_RATE 40000
MAV_PROTO_VER 2
# Reboot FC after port/protocol changes. Preserve ST-RX8S RC and TELEM1 ground radio configuration.
# MAVLink 2 is required for ODOMETRY (id 331); check compatibility of other MAVLink peripherals.
# Do NOT run MicroXRCEAgent or MAVROS on this same USB-TTL port.
